// Custom alert (Anomaly Detection app): mngr errors.
// Analyzer: static threshold | condition: ABOVE | threshold: 4 | violating samples: 3 | sliding window: 5
//           dealerting samples: 5 | alert on missing data: off
// "[ERROR" lines in the ws mngr. Fires when 3 of 5 minutes have 5 or more.
// Its normal level is not 0: if it fires too often, switch to the auto-adaptive analyzer.
fetch logs
| filter startsWith(aws.log_group, "/aws/ecs/srv/") and endsWith(aws.log_group, "-mngr")
| filter contains(content, "[ERROR")
| makeTimeseries mngr_errors = count(default: 0), interval: 1m
